Package: limnosens
Title: Limnological Sensor Physics, Unit Conversion and Instrument Correction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chris", "McBride", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chris@limnotrack.com")
Description: Deterministic, equation-based tools for limnological sensor data
    processing. Dissolved oxygen saturation calculations (Benson & Krause),
    unit conversions (mg/L ↔ %sat), barometric pressure from altitude or
    Open-Meteo API, sensor-specific corrections for Ponsel OptoD and In-Situ
    RDO, conductivity cell equilibration artifact correction (single/double
    exponential), and temperature sensor shelf/sawtooth artifact correction.
    Functions are stateless and independently testable against published values.
